---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-24 border-t border-slate-200/80 bg-white/85">
  <div class="site-container py-12 md:py-16">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="md:col-span-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/logo.png" alt="JVV Digital" class="h-10 w-auto rounded-xl shadow-sm" />
          <div>
            <div class="font-semibold tracking-tight text-jvv-dark">JVV Digital</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-500">Technical visibility for how businesses are discovered now</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
          Founder-led consulting for AI visibility, technical SEO, and strategic website builds when the current foundation needs work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-3">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-900">Pages</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
          <li><a class="transition hover:text-jvv-blue" href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li><a class="transition hover:text-jvv-blue" href="/services">Services</a></li>
          <li><a class="transition hover:text-jvv-blue" href="/about">About</a></li>
          <li><a class="transition hover:text-jvv-blue" href="/contact">Free Review</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-4">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-900">Get in touch</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
          Prefer email? Reach out at <a href="mailto:will@jvvdigital.com" class="font-medium text-jvv-blue">will@jvvdigital.com</a>.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary mt-5">Start a free review</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6 text-sm text-slate-500 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <p>&copy; {currentYear} JVV Digital.</p>
      <p>Built with Astro, Tailwind, and a light touch of orange.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
